        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Synopsis</strong>:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In an apocalyptic reality, where madness reigns, you are forced to face it in an enormous bunker. But is escaping to the outside any better? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414850/extras/cf97d5a036082ea2a37e6deb07867c96.avif?t=1785847967\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The World:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rules have changed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our home has become a desolate wasteland, taken over by <strong>Lost</strong> individuals. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lost:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;A human suffering from <i><strong>UPT</strong></i> (<i>Umbra Post-Trauma</i>)&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>UPT</strong></i> individuals suffer from <i>extreme dissociation</i>. This removes all limits the brain imposes on us (e.g.: Rotating your eyes in impossible ways, running with no feeling of getting tired, and losing social interests). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Never try to interact with a <strong>Lost</strong> individual. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414850/extras/c856f3fccc9f9fcb328b255986ca0c3f.avif?t=1785847967\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varied enemies, each with different traits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dreadful, semi-liminal atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original Soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple options to face your challenges, either go smart and sneaky, or dumb and loud </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good optimization, allowing players to enjoy smooth gameplay on low-end systems</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Synopsis</strong>:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In an apocalyptic reality, where madness reigns, you are forced to face it in an enormous bunker. But is escaping to the outside any better? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414850/extras/cf97d5a036082ea2a37e6deb07867c96.avif?t=1785847967\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The World:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rules have changed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our home has become a desolate wasteland, taken over by <strong>Lost</strong> individuals. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lost:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;A human suffering from <i><strong>UPT</strong></i> (<i>Umbra Post-Trauma</i>)&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>UPT</strong></i> individuals suffer from <i>extreme dissociation</i>. This removes all limits the brain imposes on us (e.g.: Rotating your eyes in impossible ways, running with no feeling of getting tired, and losing social interests). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Never try to interact with a <strong>Lost</strong> individual. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414850/extras/c856f3fccc9f9fcb328b255986ca0c3f.avif?t=1785847967\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varied enemies, each with different traits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dreadful, semi-liminal atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original Soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple options to face your challenges, either go smart and sneaky, or dumb and loud </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good optimization, allowing players to enjoy smooth gameplay on low-end systems</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
